  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《Mutant Monsters》將 Minecraft 的生物帶向令人毛骨悚然的全新境界！與這些標誌性生物的突變體展開激戰，每種都擁有毀滅性的力量與獨特的獎勵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擊敗突變殭屍、突變骷髏、突變苦力怕、突變終界使者等，每種都帶來嶄新的挑戰。打造強力道具、馴服會爆炸的僕從，並揭開蜘蛛豬等怪異新生物的神秘面紗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在這個生存無法保證的世界中，準備好迎接史詩般的戰鬥與傳奇級的戰利品吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 特色突變生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：體型龐大且擁有強力重擊攻擊的兇獸。擊敗它即可獲得強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克鎚</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變骷髏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：致命的神射手。擊敗它可利用其骨骼製作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變骷髏甲冑</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：以連鎖爆炸造成巨大破壞。死亡時會掉落苦力怕僕從蛋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變終界使者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：令人恐懼的瞬移高手。斬斷其手臂即可透過</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界之魂手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獲得其力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變雪人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：強力的盟友，會向敵人投擲巨大的冰塊。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👾 僕從與夥伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：從苦力怕僕從蛋中孵化出的爆炸性盟友。使用苦力怕僕從追蹤器即可馴服並追蹤它們。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蜘蛛豬</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種快速且難以預測的生物，由食用發酵蛛眼後注入化學物質X所創造。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 特殊道具</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化學物質X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種神秘的液體，能將生物突變成強大的突變體或怪異的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克鎚</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一把強力的武器，砸向地面時可將敵人擊退。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界之魂手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：從突變終界使者身上獲得瞬移與操控方塊的能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一種有毒的武器，對地形使用時會引發爆炸。透過摧毀苦力怕僕從蛋獲得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用於追蹤和控制你的苦力怕僕從的裝置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突變骷髏甲冑</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用突變骷髏骨骼打造的強力防具。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援設定，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行調整（Fabric 版需安裝由 Prospector 開發的</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，也需安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料夾中，檔名依設定類型分別為</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有模組都會具備全部類型的設定檔，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，多年前他最初發布此模組時名為《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》。絕大多數的工作，尤其是那些驚人的模型，皆由他一手完成。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他是首位將突變生物帶入現代 Minecraft 的人（透過其《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》模組），為此最終的復刻奠定了基礎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">全面翻新模組中的所有貼圖，使其符合新版 Minecraft 的美術風格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/echo-chest\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
